          "Engage education and institutional quality as a first-tier issue: with 44.3% college attainment and a median age of 41.6, this is a constituency with children in school or recently out of school who evaluate on educational quality, university access, and whether government institutions function effectively. The 63% Democratic margin suggests suburban professionals believe Democrats are better stewards of public institutions.",
