          { name: "Messaging Centered on Redistribution or Partisan Identity", tag: "avoid", why: "In a district of affluent professionals and business owners, messaging that emphasizes redistribution, partisan conflict, or ideological purity will reinforce the Republican advantage rather than convert persuadable voters. This constituency evaluates on whether government is competent, efficient, and protective of their material interests — not on whether it advances partisan team identity." }
