          "Engage the 77% Black constituency with specificity on healthcare access, educational equity, and economic mobility rather than generic Black community outreach—the $102,614 income and 36% college attainment suggest constituent sophistication about structural inequality and expectations for targeted policy solutions, not symbolic representation.",
